{"id":"wb-2-5","name":"八七会议会址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"八七会议会址","text":"八七会议会址位于中华人民共和国湖北省武汉市江岸区鄱阳街139号，1927年八七会议在此秘密召开。会址建筑原为高级公寓楼“怡和新房”的一部分，在开会当时为苏联人住所。会址被会议亲历者确定后辟为八七会议会址纪念馆。会址现为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%AB%E4%B8%83%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%AE%E4%BC%9A%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93115363,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93115363","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c2785a89549548ac54cb28cb.jpg","title":"20240622_Site_of_the_August_7_Conference_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240622_Site_of_the_August_7_Conference_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/20240622_Site_of_the_August_7_Conference_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​八七会议会址","width":320,"height":213}}